\"4cf2vhylew3T1710863944349\":[],\"8gfxrw8wla9T1710863939170\":[\"nqb471m7nmnT1710863941173\",\"z2tn3pzsbujT1710863943430\",\"4cf2vhylew3T1710863944349\"],\"nqb471m7nmnT1710863941173\":[],\"z2tn3pzsbujT1710863943430\":[]},\"contents\":{\"4cf2vhylew3T1710863944349\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e要走了吗？一路顺风！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【先不打扰了。】\"},\"8gfxrw8wla9T1710863939170\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e赫卡已经到璃月了呀，要是我能和她一起就好了…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【开场白】\"},\"nqb471m7nmnT1710863941173\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e嗯，她是我的朋友，不过她现在出门远行啦，说是收集完一百种怪物的情报才会回来…还要多久呢？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e可惜我不像她那么厉害，能独自去那么远的地方，只能在这里等她回来…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e不过我有收到她托游商带回来的画片和信，还有她为我写的图鉴，嘿嘿。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【赫卡?】\"},\"z2tn3pzsbujT1710863943430\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e是呀，卡嘉对我那么好，我却只能做一点点很简单的事回报她…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e要是我能像赫卡那么厉害就好了，那样的话，一定可以给卡嘉帮上更大的忙吧。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【你在这里工作吗？】\"}}}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"3885","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false}],"filter_values":{},"menu_id":"0","menu_name":"","version":"1769567066","langs":[],"template_layout":{"tab":[{"tab_id":"69","tab_name":"页签1","module_group":[{"module_group_id":"691","layout":"l2r1","module":[{"id":"1207","pos":"left"},{"id":"1208","pos":"right"},{"id":"3882","pos":"banner"}],"name":"基本资料","repeated":false,"parent_group_id":"0"},{"module_group_id":"692","layout":"l1r1","module":[{"id":"1209","pos":"banner"}],"name